1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:02,240
(All people, incidents,
and backgrounds...)

2
00:00:02,310 --> 00:00:03,480
(in this drama are fictitious
and unrelated to reality.)

3
00:00:03,540 --> 00:00:05,040
(Also, children were filmed
under production guidelines.)

4
00:00:06,410 --> 00:00:07,650
(Episode 4)

5
00:01:12,010 --> 00:01:13,550
The DNA test results are in.

6
00:01:13,610 --> 00:01:14,810
(Korea Genetic Analysis Center)

7
00:01:26,020 --> 00:01:28,030
Hae Ra, that's enough shopping.

8
00:01:28,390 --> 00:01:29,390
Don't stop me.

9
00:01:29,390 --> 00:01:31,500
I'll go crazy if I don't blow off
some steam like this.

10
00:01:46,140 --> 00:01:47,780
(Joo Ae Sook, Ko Eun Seol:
No genetic match)

11
00:01:50,550 --> 00:01:53,080
(No match)

12
00:01:56,490 --> 00:01:58,960
What... What on earth?

13
00:01:59,990 --> 00:02:01,190
No genetic match?

14
00:02:04,260 --> 00:02:07,870
Then Eun Seol isn't
Ae Sook's daughter?

15
00:02:21,410 --> 00:02:24,220
Your daughter takes after you
and is beautiful.

16
00:02:41,770 --> 00:02:42,770
Are you all right?

17
00:02:43,670 --> 00:02:45,100
Where are you hurt?

18
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:47,540
Please, you have to help me.

19
00:02:52,040 --> 00:02:53,040
Ae Sook...

20
00:02:54,150 --> 00:02:55,280
Aren't you Ae Sook?

21
00:02:55,680 --> 00:02:58,250
Joo Ae Sook
from Yeongsu High, right?

22
00:02:59,620 --> 00:03:00,620
Park Hee Jung?

23
00:03:00,690 --> 00:03:04,260
Oh, you remember me.
But what's wrong?

24
00:03:04,260 --> 00:03:05,290
Why are you in so much pain?

25
00:03:05,890 --> 00:03:08,160
The baby... The baby's coming.

26
00:03:08,590 --> 00:03:12,100
What? My goodness.
Let's get you to the hospital.

27
00:03:12,760 --> 00:03:13,770
Watch your step.

28
00:03:19,140 --> 00:03:20,140
What happened?

29
00:03:21,670 --> 00:03:23,640
I'm sure Ae Sook gave birth
to Eun Seol.

30
00:03:26,540 --> 00:03:27,980
There's no way the test was wrong.

31
00:03:30,280 --> 00:03:31,280
Then could it be...

32
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:34,550
Were the babies switched?

33
00:03:36,650 --> 00:03:38,190
- How much longer do I have to wait?
- My gosh!

34
00:03:38,390 --> 00:03:39,590
You scared me more.

35
00:03:40,760 --> 00:03:42,530
Would it kill you to knock first?

36
00:03:42,790 --> 00:03:44,500
Never mind knocking.

37
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:46,300
You said you'd find
Eun Seol's birth mother.

38
00:03:46,300 --> 00:03:47,770
Why haven't I heard anything?

39
00:03:48,470 --> 00:03:50,700
Mother, I have to go out
for a moment.

40
00:03:51,670 --> 00:03:53,740
What? Hey, hold on.

41
00:03:55,770 --> 00:03:56,810
What's with her?

42
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,240
Birth records?

43
00:03:59,510 --> 00:04:03,050
Yes. My daughter was born here
17 years ago,

44
00:04:03,650 --> 00:04:04,920
and I think she was switched.

45
00:04:05,380 --> 00:04:06,750
Your baby was switched?

46
00:04:07,050 --> 00:04:10,020
I'd like to see the birth records
from around that same time.

47
00:04:10,820 --> 00:04:11,820
Would that be possible?

48
00:04:12,090 --> 00:04:13,090
I'm sorry.

49
00:04:13,190 --> 00:04:15,630
There's no guarantee
they were switched here,

50
00:04:15,660 --> 00:04:16,890
and per hospital policy,

51
00:04:16,960 --> 00:04:18,930
we can't show you
other patients' records.

52
00:04:21,830 --> 00:04:25,000
Then what am I supposed to do?

53
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:27,810
If you file a claim
through the proper legal channels,

54
00:04:27,910 --> 00:04:29,640
our legal team will respond.

55
00:04:30,980 --> 00:04:32,980
Legal channels?

56
00:04:33,180 --> 00:04:37,320
(Exam Room 3:
Dr. Hong So Young, OB-GYN)

57
00:04:37,420 --> 00:04:39,950
I never get used to these
gynecology appointments,

58
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:41,420
no matter how many I have.

59
00:04:41,790 --> 00:04:43,990
Still, what can you do?
Regular checkups are a must.

60
00:04:44,860 --> 00:04:46,860
I removed a small polyp
from your uterus.

61
00:04:47,860 --> 00:04:49,030
Everything else looks fine.

62
00:04:49,960 --> 00:04:51,460
- Thanks.
- Don't mention it.

63
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:54,200
It's about dinnertime.
Want to get dinner together?

64
00:04:54,270 --> 00:04:56,430
Sure. Treat me to something good.

65
00:04:56,900 --> 00:04:59,470
- What do you want?
- Something expensive, of course.

66
00:04:59,900 --> 00:05:02,210
- Recommend something good.
- Maybe I will.

67
00:05:05,010 --> 00:05:06,010
- Let's go.
- Sure.

68
00:05:07,950 --> 00:05:09,150
We should see each other more often.

69
00:05:09,850 --> 00:05:11,250
Wouldn't that be a bad sign for me?

70
00:05:13,620 --> 00:05:16,090
No, I mean for a meal
or a cup of tea.

71
00:05:16,890 --> 00:05:19,560
What was the name
of your new project again?

72
00:05:20,260 --> 00:05:21,260
"Blue Season."

73
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:24,530
It's my first lead role in a while.
I'm so nervous.

74
00:05:24,760 --> 00:05:27,930
I can't believe
the great Kim Jung Sun gets nervous.

75
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:29,800
I'm hardly great.

76
00:05:30,330 --> 00:05:31,400
Like you aren't.

77
00:05:38,440 --> 00:05:43,150
(17 years ago)

78
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:48,390
What are you doing here?

79
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,590
It's nothing.

80
00:05:56,860 --> 00:05:58,200
What are you staring at?

81
00:06:01,470 --> 00:06:04,540
- Look at her twitching.
- Hey, that's Kim Jung Sun, right?

82
00:06:07,670 --> 00:06:09,410
A top star with a happy family.

83
00:06:10,370 --> 00:06:13,040
How did she get so lucky
to have everything?

84
00:06:15,610 --> 00:06:16,610
All of it...

85
00:06:17,120 --> 00:06:18,550
was supposed to be mine.

86
00:06:20,850 --> 00:06:23,250
What do you mean, it was yours?

87
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:30,700
How do you think you'd feel
if your entire life...

88
00:06:31,800 --> 00:06:32,830
was stolen?

89
00:06:35,630 --> 00:06:36,630
I don't know.

90
00:06:38,470 --> 00:06:39,740
What do you mean, you don't know?

91
00:06:42,470 --> 00:06:43,780
You have to take it back.

92
00:06:54,420 --> 00:06:55,490
Let's go.

93
00:06:55,990 --> 00:06:57,360
Gosh, I'm starving.

94
00:07:01,460 --> 00:07:02,460
Goodness.

95
00:07:04,000 --> 00:07:06,330
Hasn't Hae Ra said she wants
to be an actress like you?

96
00:07:07,230 --> 00:07:08,930
She's tried a few times.

97
00:07:09,330 --> 00:07:10,700
But I guess
she didn't take after me.

98
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:12,100
She has no talent for it.

99
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:14,770
Oh, one second.

100
00:07:15,810 --> 00:07:16,810
My phone's vibrating.

101
00:07:18,540 --> 00:07:20,780
Yes, I'm in the lobby.
I'll be right out.

102
00:07:21,380 --> 00:07:22,380
Okay.

103
00:07:23,780 --> 00:07:25,920
- Who was that?
- Manager Joo.

104
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:26,980
I see.

105
00:07:30,490 --> 00:07:32,590
Manager Joo? Isn't that Ae Sook?

106
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:59,120
(Taeseon Hospital)

107
00:08:05,920 --> 00:08:08,690
(Kim Jung Sun)

108
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:14,800
(Born in1969, Seoul)

109
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:17,700
(Kim Jung Sun)

110
00:08:22,870 --> 00:08:26,010
(Kang Hae Ra)

111
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,450
Midong High School.

112
00:08:33,150 --> 00:08:35,420
She went to the same school
as Eun Seol?

113
00:08:37,860 --> 00:08:39,260
I'm home.

114
00:08:39,720 --> 00:08:41,590
Hey, where have you been?

115
00:08:41,590 --> 00:08:43,430
I started a part-time job today...

116
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:44,930
waiting tables at a snack bar.

117
00:08:45,230 --> 00:08:46,660
You should be resting.

118
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:49,230
What's the point?
It'd just get my mind racing.

119
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:52,400
Eun Seol.

120
00:08:53,640 --> 00:08:54,910
At your school,

121
00:08:55,540 --> 00:08:57,210
is there a student
named Kang Hae Ra?

122
00:08:58,240 --> 00:09:00,440
How do you know Kang Hae Ra?

123
00:09:02,210 --> 00:09:03,450
You know her too?

124
00:09:05,180 --> 00:09:07,080
She's the reason I got expelled.

125
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:09,620
She's the one who set fire
to the art room.

126
00:09:10,090 --> 00:09:12,720
She confessed it to my face,
knowing I had no proof.

127
00:09:13,860 --> 00:09:16,290
- What?
- Her family is super rich.

128
00:09:16,590 --> 00:09:19,600
You know Cheongma Fashion, right?
She's the owner's daughter.

129
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:24,400
But seriously, how do you know her?

130
00:09:26,070 --> 00:09:28,010
I don't. How would I?

131
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:32,540
I just thought I heard
a top star's daughter went to your school.

132
00:09:33,380 --> 00:09:36,080
That's right.
Her mom's Kim Jung Sun.

133
00:09:46,360 --> 00:09:48,090
Seok Jin, how have you been?

134
00:09:48,630 --> 00:09:51,100
If you have some time now,
could we meet up?

135
00:09:51,100 --> 00:09:52,600
(Ko Eun Seol)

136
00:10:02,010 --> 00:10:03,110
Have you been waiting long?

137
00:10:04,140 --> 00:10:05,210
Did you run here?

138
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:06,880
No.

139
00:10:07,010 --> 00:10:08,780
Then stop catching your breath.

140
00:10:09,850 --> 00:10:11,020
Here, drink this.

141
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:12,720
Thanks.

142
00:10:20,420 --> 00:10:22,490
What's the occasion?
You never call me first.

143
00:10:23,390 --> 00:10:24,960
Is there a rule against
me calling you first?

144
00:10:25,360 --> 00:10:28,170
Who said you couldn't?
I'm just happy you did.

145
00:10:30,130 --> 00:10:31,140
Whatever.

146
00:10:31,700 --> 00:10:32,770
Just take this.

147
00:10:34,710 --> 00:10:35,810
What's this?

148
00:10:42,250 --> 00:10:43,310
I'm saying...

149
00:10:44,080 --> 00:10:45,380
I'll buy this painting.

150
00:10:45,920 --> 00:10:47,320
I really want this piece.

151
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,590
Do you know
why I like your paintings?

152
00:10:52,190 --> 00:10:53,320
Because they're honest.

153
00:10:57,030 --> 00:10:58,600
The way you express...

154
00:10:59,930 --> 00:11:02,370
various emotions through shadows...

155
00:11:04,070 --> 00:11:05,940
made me feel like
I was looking at myself.

156
00:11:07,570 --> 00:11:08,970
At my innermost thoughts.

157
00:11:11,410 --> 00:11:15,180
I've rarely been honest
about my feelings.

158
00:11:17,150 --> 00:11:20,380
In fact, I've never really
had the time to process them.

159
00:11:21,690 --> 00:11:22,750
That's why...

160
00:11:25,720 --> 00:11:27,390
That's why I believe you.

161
00:11:31,730 --> 00:11:33,330
Did you paint this again for me?

162
00:11:34,030 --> 00:11:35,030
Well...

163
00:11:35,430 --> 00:11:38,370
I don't have school anymore,
so I've got nothing but time.

164
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:45,910
Getting expelled isn't all bad then.

165
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,240
What did you just say?

166
00:11:49,280 --> 00:11:50,380
Nothing. I take it back.

167
00:11:56,720 --> 00:11:58,020
I really lucked out today.

168
00:11:58,520 --> 00:12:01,230
Is there anything you want to eat?
Just say the word. It's on me.

169
00:12:01,560 --> 00:12:02,560
That's okay.

170
00:12:02,730 --> 00:12:04,660
What do you mean, that's okay?
Let's go.

171
00:12:05,300 --> 00:12:07,600
- Hey, I said it's fine.
- I said let's go.

172
00:12:07,600 --> 00:12:10,430
What are you doing? Let go.
Someone might see us.

173
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:13,470
Hey, aren't those Seok Jin
and Ko Eun Seol over there?

174
00:12:13,870 --> 00:12:15,140
I think you're right.

175
00:12:15,510 --> 00:12:17,310
- No way.
- Darn, let's follow them.

176
00:12:21,950 --> 00:12:24,080
- Two orders of tteokbokki, please.
- Okay.

177
00:12:24,150 --> 00:12:25,150
Of all things,
you picked tteokbokki?

178
00:12:27,990 --> 00:12:30,090
Oh, that's not what I meant.

179
00:12:31,060 --> 00:12:33,690
I'm sorry, ma'am.
I really didn't mean it like that.

180
00:12:35,160 --> 00:12:36,260
Say something.

181
00:12:36,960 --> 00:12:38,400
What am I supposed to say?

182
00:12:44,740 --> 00:12:46,340
- What a joke.
- What a joke.

183
00:12:52,580 --> 00:12:53,580
Is it good?

184
00:12:54,080 --> 00:12:56,110
If you want some,
get a spoon and try it.

185
00:12:56,650 --> 00:12:58,550
Why bother?
I'm just going to have one bite.

186
00:13:00,380 --> 00:13:01,790
Gosh, that's good.

187
00:13:02,190 --> 00:13:04,420
Wait, what was that?

188
00:13:06,160 --> 00:13:08,290
You try some.
It'll taste even better.

189
00:13:13,300 --> 00:13:14,370
You eat it.

190
00:13:16,930 --> 00:13:19,040
- Wasn't it enough?
- No...

191
00:13:19,500 --> 00:13:20,640
It's fine.

192
00:13:21,310 --> 00:13:22,640
- That's insane.
- That's insane.

193
00:13:24,580 --> 00:13:26,340
- Have they lost their minds?
- What are they doing?

194
00:13:26,410 --> 00:13:28,150
- Forget it.
- Just try it.

195
00:13:28,210 --> 00:13:29,210
No, you eat it.

196
00:13:29,550 --> 00:13:30,850
They're doing what?

197
00:13:31,950 --> 00:13:32,980
Where are they?

198
00:13:35,150 --> 00:13:37,190
Okay, wait for me.
I'll be right there.

199
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:48,000
Who are you?

200
00:13:52,470 --> 00:13:53,700
What are you doing at school?

201
00:13:55,610 --> 00:13:56,870
Are you here to see
the Vice Principal?

202
00:13:57,340 --> 00:13:58,340
Yes.

203
00:14:00,210 --> 00:14:01,350
Who's this?

204
00:14:02,810 --> 00:14:04,920
A friend. I just ran into her.

205
00:14:06,850 --> 00:14:08,090
You're that woman from before.

206
00:14:09,790 --> 00:14:11,260
Are you here to see Manager Joo?

207
00:14:11,490 --> 00:14:12,490
What?

208
00:14:15,090 --> 00:14:16,090
Oh, yes.

209
00:14:16,990 --> 00:14:19,830
- Is she in?
- No, she stepped out.

210
00:14:23,600 --> 00:14:26,470
Anyway, don't just show up here
whenever you feel like it.

211
00:14:26,770 --> 00:14:28,640
This isn't a place where just anyone
can wander in and out.

212
00:14:32,810 --> 00:14:33,940
That brat.

213
00:14:37,080 --> 00:14:39,180
- They must be crazy.
- It looks like they're dating.

214
00:14:39,780 --> 00:14:41,520
- Hae Ra's here.
- Where are they?

215
00:14:41,990 --> 00:14:44,860
Seok Jin left, and Ko Eun Seol
is working part-time inside.

216
00:14:53,430 --> 00:14:54,570
Welcome.

217
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,400
What should we get?

218
00:14:58,770 --> 00:15:00,940
Order anything you want.
It's my treat.

219
00:15:01,210 --> 00:15:03,240
- Really?
- Awesome.

220
00:15:05,610 --> 00:15:06,610
This looks so good.

221
00:15:08,310 --> 00:15:10,250
What are you doing?
Aren't you going to take our order?

222
00:15:14,890 --> 00:15:16,750
Go on. What'll you have?

223
00:15:18,060 --> 00:15:20,320
I can't believe a waitress
is talking to me like that.

224
00:15:21,830 --> 00:15:23,830
What can I get for you, ma'am?

225
00:15:27,900 --> 00:15:29,600
Is this where she's working?

226
00:15:29,900 --> 00:15:33,100
I started a part-time job today
waiting tables at a snack bar.

227
00:15:33,340 --> 00:15:34,740
You should be resting.

228
00:15:35,110 --> 00:15:37,270
What's the point?
It'd just get my mind racing.

229
00:15:57,860 --> 00:16:00,500
Oh no. Are you okay? I'm sorry.

230
00:16:03,600 --> 00:16:04,600
I'm sorry.

231
00:16:07,300 --> 00:16:09,170
Do I look okay to you?

232
00:16:09,810 --> 00:16:11,310
Do you have any idea
how much this costs?

233
00:16:11,510 --> 00:16:12,880
It costs 1,000 dollars.

234
00:16:13,010 --> 00:16:14,210
Do you have that kind of money?

235
00:16:14,310 --> 00:16:15,350
I'll pay for it.

236
00:16:17,010 --> 00:16:18,020
Mom.

237
00:16:20,250 --> 00:16:21,920
I'll pay that 1,000 dollars.

238
00:16:22,790 --> 00:16:23,820
What?

239
00:16:25,220 --> 00:16:28,060
Give me your account number.
I'll wire the money right now.

240
00:16:29,090 --> 00:16:30,460
Forget it, lady.

241
00:16:34,830 --> 00:16:36,330
I said give me your account number.

242
00:16:49,910 --> 00:16:51,150
Are you just getting in?

243
00:16:52,050 --> 00:16:53,620
What's wrong with her?

244
00:16:54,790 --> 00:16:55,850
Hae Ra.

245
00:16:57,550 --> 00:16:59,860
What's wrong? What happened?

246
00:17:01,530 --> 00:17:03,590
Don't talk to me.
I'm beyond annoyed.

247
00:17:04,230 --> 00:17:06,530
Spit it out. What is it?

248
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:09,870
Mom, I have to study abroad
with Seok Jin,

249
00:17:09,870 --> 00:17:11,340
so try to talk him into it.

250
00:17:11,770 --> 00:17:14,000
- Got it?
- How am I supposed to do that?

251
00:17:14,070 --> 00:17:15,810
Whatever it takes.

252
00:17:16,110 --> 00:17:17,210
What's gotten into you?

253
00:17:19,310 --> 00:17:21,850
By the way, did you meet that woman?

254
00:17:23,580 --> 00:17:24,950
That woman? Who?

255
00:17:25,020 --> 00:17:26,280
Ko Eun Seol's mom.

256
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:28,690
She stopped by earlier today.
You didn't see her?

257
00:17:28,950 --> 00:17:29,950
Really?

258
00:17:30,290 --> 00:17:31,790
I wonder what brought her
all the way out here.

259
00:17:32,020 --> 00:17:34,390
Why are you hanging out
with a woman like that?

260
00:17:34,530 --> 00:17:35,960
Be more selective
about who you meet.

261
00:17:36,030 --> 00:17:37,260
Don't just associate with anyone.

262
00:17:40,930 --> 00:17:44,130
Who is she talking about?

263
00:17:44,800 --> 00:17:46,170
It's no one, really.

264
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:48,140
Ma'am, please don't worry about it.

265
00:17:50,170 --> 00:17:52,010
My gosh, Jung Sun is here.

266
00:17:52,610 --> 00:17:54,380
Welcome, Jung Sun.

267
00:17:55,710 --> 00:17:58,020
Have you been well, So Yeon?

268
00:17:58,350 --> 00:17:59,650
Of course.

269
00:18:00,920 --> 00:18:03,220
- Hello.
- Yes, hi.

270
00:18:07,830 --> 00:18:09,660
You want me to take my mother too?

271
00:18:10,990 --> 00:18:14,230
I thought it'd be good for So Yeon
to get treatment in the US too.

272
00:18:17,270 --> 00:18:21,040
So Yeon, you'd like to go
to the US with Seok Jin, right?

273
00:18:22,410 --> 00:18:25,840
As long as I'm with Seok Jin,
I'll be happy anywhere.

274
00:18:31,080 --> 00:18:34,080
I see you still keep that photo up.

275
00:18:35,150 --> 00:18:36,150
Oh, that.

276
00:18:36,850 --> 00:18:38,260
My mother likes it.

277
00:18:38,960 --> 00:18:40,360
That reminds me...

278
00:18:40,790 --> 00:18:43,390
of when we all took
family trips together.

279
00:18:43,990 --> 00:18:45,530
Those were such good times.

280
00:18:47,600 --> 00:18:49,630
Anyway, think about it.

281
00:18:50,200 --> 00:18:52,340
And don't worry about
So Yeon's hospital bills.

282
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:55,010
Okay.

283
00:18:57,880 --> 00:18:59,310
Honey, you have a call.

284
00:19:02,210 --> 00:19:04,410
- Who is it?
- It's an unknown number.

285
00:19:08,320 --> 00:19:09,320
Hello.

286
00:19:09,820 --> 00:19:12,920
It's me, Joo Mi Ran.
We need to talk.

287
00:19:13,960 --> 00:19:16,530
Perfect timing. Okay, let's meet.

288
00:19:17,090 --> 00:19:18,260
Where should we meet?

289
00:19:22,930 --> 00:19:24,670
I'm heading out for a little while.

290
00:19:25,000 --> 00:19:26,340
I can't wait any longer.

291
00:19:26,670 --> 00:19:27,910
Can't wait for what?

292
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:30,410
It's been ages since you said
you'd look for Eun Seol's birth mom.

293
00:19:30,510 --> 00:19:32,210
If you don't solve this
by the end of the month,

294
00:19:32,280 --> 00:19:34,280
I'm kicking Eun Seol out,
just so you know.

295
00:19:34,680 --> 00:19:35,710
Don't worry.

296
00:19:35,810 --> 00:19:37,480
I'm on my way
to take care of it now.

297
00:19:44,050 --> 00:19:45,460
Looks like she found her, Mom.

298
00:19:46,320 --> 00:19:49,260
Hey, don't jump the gun.
Let's wait and see what happens.

299
00:19:51,660 --> 00:19:53,160
I heard you came by the house.

300
00:19:54,770 --> 00:19:56,000
I wasn't there to see you.

301
00:19:56,800 --> 00:19:59,100
If not me, who were you visiting?

302
00:19:59,200 --> 00:20:00,540
I went to see Kim Jung Sun.

303
00:20:01,340 --> 00:20:02,710
For what reason?

304
00:20:03,270 --> 00:20:04,470
To confirm something.

305
00:20:06,110 --> 00:20:08,510
What were you trying to confirm
with Ms. Kim?

306
00:20:09,650 --> 00:20:10,880
A DNA test.

307
00:20:11,080 --> 00:20:12,250
What did you just say?

308
00:20:18,260 --> 00:20:19,260
Here.

309
00:20:20,860 --> 00:20:23,660
- What's this?
- See for yourself.

310
00:20:29,670 --> 00:20:31,740
(DNA Test Results:
Joo Ae Sook, Kang Hae Ra)

311
00:20:31,800 --> 00:20:33,670
(A 99.999 percent genetic match)

312
00:20:35,910 --> 00:20:37,840
- What's this?
- What do you think?

313
00:20:38,340 --> 00:20:40,240
This proves that Kang Hae Ra
is your daughter.

314
00:20:40,340 --> 00:20:41,380
Hey!

315
00:20:43,150 --> 00:20:44,920
How dare you forge a DNA report?

316
00:20:45,220 --> 00:20:46,380
It wasn't forged.

317
00:20:48,490 --> 00:20:49,920
This is the cup you drank from,

318
00:20:51,560 --> 00:20:52,690
and these are Kang Hae Ra's clothes.

319
00:20:54,420 --> 00:20:56,230
That Kang Hae Ra is a spoiled brat.

320
00:20:57,030 --> 00:21:00,860
She tossed out a 1,000-dollar outfit
just because food got on it.

321
00:21:06,370 --> 00:21:08,470
What on earth have you done?

322
00:21:09,610 --> 00:21:10,840
Switching the babies?

323
00:21:11,780 --> 00:21:12,780
Why?

324
00:21:13,180 --> 00:21:15,350
Was it to raise your daughter
as an heiress?

325
00:21:15,410 --> 00:21:17,710
You sacrificed Eun Seol
so that your daughter...

326
00:21:19,150 --> 00:21:20,920
could live in luxury?

327
00:21:28,090 --> 00:21:29,430
How much will it take?

328
00:21:30,560 --> 00:21:31,560
What?

329
00:21:31,730 --> 00:21:34,870
What's your price
for keeping this a secret?

330
00:21:34,870 --> 00:21:35,900
Joo Ae Sook, seriously?

331
00:21:35,970 --> 00:21:38,300
I told you, it's Joo Mi Ran,
not Joo Ae Sook.

332
00:21:38,370 --> 00:21:39,370
Fine, Joo Mi Ran.

333
00:21:40,570 --> 00:21:42,970
Do you really think
money can solve this?

334
00:21:45,940 --> 00:21:48,650
Let's be honest.
This has nothing to do with you.

335
00:21:49,580 --> 00:21:51,250
It wasn't your baby who was swapped.

336
00:21:51,920 --> 00:21:54,380
I switched my daughter
with Kim Jung Sun's.

337
00:21:55,690 --> 00:21:56,950
Whoever's daughter she was,

338
00:21:57,190 --> 00:21:59,590
you just adopted and raised her.
Am I wrong?

339
00:22:01,460 --> 00:22:04,730
I heard you kept her adoption
a secret until recently.

340
00:22:05,960 --> 00:22:08,870
That shows
how much Eun Seol means to you.

341
00:22:10,130 --> 00:22:12,570
After raising her lovingly
for 17 years,

342
00:22:12,640 --> 00:22:14,570
you're just going
to give her up this easily?

343
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:20,840
You're only doing this
because of your mother-in-law.

344
00:22:22,250 --> 00:22:24,510
That's why I'm offering
to solve your problem with money.

345
00:22:27,480 --> 00:22:28,590
Fine. I'm listening.

346
00:22:30,250 --> 00:22:32,690
Since all you talk about is money,
how much are you offering?

347
00:22:32,760 --> 00:22:34,220
How does 500,000 dollars sound?

348
00:22:39,730 --> 00:22:41,160
You get the money,

349
00:22:41,700 --> 00:22:44,940
and you get to keep raising Eun Seol
as your daughter.

350
00:22:45,540 --> 00:22:47,100
What's not to like about that offer?

351
00:22:49,610 --> 00:22:51,040
Do you need time to think about it?

352
00:22:54,210 --> 00:22:55,780
I can't wait long.

353
00:22:56,750 --> 00:22:58,580
Let me know
when you've made up your mind.

354
00:23:12,800 --> 00:23:13,800
Did you say 500,000 dollars?

355
00:23:14,260 --> 00:23:15,270
Wait.

356
00:23:15,270 --> 00:23:18,170
Did Eun Seol's birth mom really say
she'd give you 500,000 dollars?

357
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:20,970
That said,
you have to give me your word.

358
00:23:21,340 --> 00:23:23,770
Promise you'll never
mistreat Eun Seol again.

359
00:23:23,940 --> 00:23:25,940
Why would I mistreat her?

360
00:23:26,040 --> 00:23:27,480
Not when
there's 500,000 dollars involved.

361
00:23:28,250 --> 00:23:31,250
And I'm going to send Eun Seol
to art school.

362
00:23:31,980 --> 00:23:34,550
With 500,000 dollars, she can go
anywhere, not just art school.

363
00:23:35,020 --> 00:23:36,450
That's up to you.

364
00:23:37,150 --> 00:23:39,090
So, when will we get the money?

365
00:23:44,530 --> 00:23:45,830
Have you thought about it?

366
00:23:46,760 --> 00:23:49,270
Will you accept my offer?

367
00:23:50,470 --> 00:23:51,840
On one condition.

368
00:23:52,940 --> 00:23:54,070
A condition?

369
00:23:55,470 --> 00:23:56,670
What is it? Tell me.

370
00:23:57,370 --> 00:23:59,380
Cancel Eun Seol's expulsion...

371
00:23:59,440 --> 00:24:00,880
and let her go back to school.

372
00:24:02,810 --> 00:24:06,450
All right.
I'll see what I can do. Happy now?

373
00:24:06,880 --> 00:24:07,880
One more thing.

374
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:10,090
What else?

375
00:24:10,320 --> 00:24:12,760
Tell Kang Hae Ra
to apologize to Eun Seol...

376
00:24:13,060 --> 00:24:14,930
for framing her
for the art room fire.

377
00:24:16,260 --> 00:24:17,360
I can't do that.

378
00:24:17,630 --> 00:24:18,960
Why not?

379
00:24:20,100 --> 00:24:21,530
I'll apologize instead.

380
00:24:21,600 --> 00:24:23,670
Tell Kang Hae Ra to do it herself.

381
00:24:24,600 --> 00:24:26,440
If you do, I'll accept your offer.

382
00:24:27,700 --> 00:24:28,710
Hee Jung!

383
00:24:33,980 --> 00:24:36,510
Do something for who? Apologize?

384
00:24:37,580 --> 00:24:41,020
Yes.
Just this once, please do as I say.

385
00:24:41,480 --> 00:24:42,950
I'm begging you.

386
00:24:44,090 --> 00:24:45,690
Manager Joo,
did your brain get fried?

387
00:24:46,090 --> 00:24:49,260
Why? Does Ko Eun Seol's mom
want an apology from me?

388
00:24:49,730 --> 00:24:50,730
Yes.

389
00:24:50,730 --> 00:24:52,500
- So...
- Tell her to forget it.

390
00:24:52,860 --> 00:24:54,900
If you want to apologize,
Manager Joo, you do it.

391
00:24:55,630 --> 00:24:57,570
There's no denying
you were in the wrong.

392
00:24:58,640 --> 00:25:01,270
Since when do you care about
right and wrong, Manager Joo?

393
00:25:01,970 --> 00:25:03,310
You're acting so strange today.

394
00:25:04,010 --> 00:25:07,540
Should I tell the CEO
about this then?

395
00:25:07,910 --> 00:25:09,210
Are you threatening me?

396
00:25:10,680 --> 00:25:13,180
Then stop being so stubborn
and do as I say.

397
00:25:13,550 --> 00:25:14,550
Understood?

398
00:25:25,830 --> 00:25:28,000
Yes. I'm almost there, Mom.

399
00:25:28,570 --> 00:25:29,770
I'll be there in a minute.

400
00:25:30,200 --> 00:25:31,400
Hey, Ko Eun Seol.

401
00:25:33,500 --> 00:25:35,840
Hae Ra wants to see you. Follow us.

402
00:25:47,580 --> 00:25:49,320
Where are we going?

403
00:25:53,860 --> 00:25:55,390
Long time no see, Ko Eun Seol.

404
00:25:56,990 --> 00:25:59,300
What is it? If you have
something to say, say it.

405
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:02,830
Your mom wants me
to apologize to you.

406
00:26:02,930 --> 00:26:03,930
My mom?

407
00:26:05,970 --> 00:26:06,970
Then do it.

408
00:26:09,170 --> 00:26:10,870
But I'm not going to.

409
00:26:11,410 --> 00:26:12,940
Then why did you call me here?

410
00:26:13,310 --> 00:26:15,410
So you can go and tell your mom...

411
00:26:16,880 --> 00:26:20,120
to know her place
and stay out of my business.

412
00:26:21,520 --> 00:26:24,350
Say that again.
What did you say about my mom?

413
00:26:28,460 --> 00:26:30,760
Are you crazy?
Who do you think you're grabbing?

414
00:26:31,090 --> 00:26:33,430
What are you doing?
Don't just stand there.

415
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:37,170
You're crazy.

416
00:26:37,330 --> 00:26:39,270
How dare you grab Hae Ra
by the collar?

417
00:26:39,670 --> 00:26:40,870
You crazy witch.

418
00:26:50,910 --> 00:26:53,180
She should be here by now.
What's taking her so long?

419
00:27:05,060 --> 00:27:06,060
What?

420
00:27:06,600 --> 00:27:07,600
Why are you looking at me?

421
00:27:07,660 --> 00:27:09,600
Stomp on her. I said, keep stomping!

422
00:27:13,240 --> 00:27:14,240
Sure.

423
00:27:17,210 --> 00:27:18,580
Is she crazy?

424
00:27:21,780 --> 00:27:23,150
What are you kids doing here?

425
00:27:24,950 --> 00:27:26,250
Hey, run.

426
00:27:26,820 --> 00:27:27,950
Eun Seol!

427
00:27:29,450 --> 00:27:30,490
Eun Seol.

428
00:27:30,890 --> 00:27:33,760
What in the world happened?
Eun Seol, wake up!

429
00:27:35,530 --> 00:27:36,530
Mom...

430
00:28:04,090 --> 00:28:05,620
Who is it this late?

431
00:28:06,990 --> 00:28:08,360
(You have a visitor.)

432
00:28:10,490 --> 00:28:11,490
What?

433
00:28:11,860 --> 00:28:13,400
What's she doing here this late?

434
00:28:17,600 --> 00:28:18,800
Hey, what are you doing here?

435
00:28:21,040 --> 00:28:22,410
Hey, Park Hee Jung!

436
00:28:24,010 --> 00:28:25,810
Kim Jung Sun?
Ms. Kim, where are you?

437
00:28:25,810 --> 00:28:26,980
- Hey!
- Ms. Kim!

438
00:28:26,980 --> 00:28:28,140
Are you crazy?

439
00:28:28,240 --> 00:28:30,250
Why are you looking for Ms. Kim
at this hour?

440
00:28:30,350 --> 00:28:31,510
Where's Ms. Kim?

441
00:28:32,220 --> 00:28:33,250
She's away on a shoot.

442
00:28:33,520 --> 00:28:34,550
What about CEO Kang Young Hoon?

443
00:28:35,350 --> 00:28:36,490
Why on earth...

444
00:28:36,650 --> 00:28:38,590
are you looking
for the CEO and his wife?

445
00:28:38,860 --> 00:28:39,960
Why do you think?

446
00:28:40,190 --> 00:28:41,860
I'm going to expose
everything you've done.

447
00:28:43,560 --> 00:28:44,560
What did you say?

448
00:28:44,930 --> 00:28:45,930
Where's Kang Hae Ra?

449
00:28:46,630 --> 00:28:47,700
Oh, is she upstairs?

450
00:28:48,770 --> 00:28:49,770
Hey!

451
00:29:01,480 --> 00:29:04,110
Darn it. What the heck?

452
00:29:06,080 --> 00:29:08,520
What... How did you get in here?

453
00:29:17,330 --> 00:29:20,560
How dare you hit my daughter?
Do you have any idea who you are?

454
00:29:28,000 --> 00:29:29,170
Are you insane, lady?

455
00:29:29,470 --> 00:29:30,540
That's right, I've lost it.

456
00:29:31,340 --> 00:29:32,710
Wouldn't you be crazy too?

457
00:29:32,940 --> 00:29:34,410
My daughter was beaten
half to death.

458
00:29:34,980 --> 00:29:38,250
She grabbed me first.
Get your facts straight!

459
00:29:41,280 --> 00:29:43,590
Get your facts straight
before you get cheeky.

460
00:29:45,420 --> 00:29:46,490
Do you know who you are?

461
00:29:48,190 --> 00:29:50,990
What do you mean,
do I know who I am?

462
00:29:53,800 --> 00:29:55,030
So you really have no clue...

463
00:29:55,830 --> 00:29:56,830
who you are.

464
00:29:58,200 --> 00:29:59,370
You're...

465
00:30:35,740 --> 00:30:39,610
(A Trap Called Desire)

466
00:30:39,810 --> 00:30:41,380
You found my birth mother?

467
00:30:41,610 --> 00:30:42,950
Is it because you don't want
to raise me anymore?

468
00:30:43,380 --> 00:30:44,510
You were going to abandon me anyway.

469
00:30:44,510 --> 00:30:46,180
What's wrong with leaving
on my own terms...

470
00:30:46,180 --> 00:30:47,220
before I get kicked out?

471
00:30:47,280 --> 00:30:48,350
How could you?

472
00:30:49,290 --> 00:30:50,450
I've decided to study abroad.

473
00:30:50,590 --> 00:30:52,760
I'll never forget you,
so promise me...

474
00:30:52,920 --> 00:30:54,220
you won't forget me either.

475
00:30:54,590 --> 00:30:56,160
What did she mean about me
not knowing who I really am?

476
00:30:56,390 --> 00:30:57,760
What do you think she meant?

477
00:30:58,090 --> 00:31:00,460
If something was taken from you,
you have to take it back.

478
00:31:00,930 --> 00:31:03,530
I'm going to take it back
and return it to Eun Seol.

479
00:31:03,930 --> 00:31:05,600
I'm asking this of you
one last time.

480
00:31:06,540 --> 00:31:08,070
Are you sure you won't regret this?

481
00:31:08,710 --> 00:31:10,970
You should've taken
this last chance.

482
00:31:12,240 --> 00:31:14,240
(Subtitles are provided by KOCOWA.)
